      "content": "That's a good start, but it feels a bit too brief. Can you make it more formal? I want to make sure I include my specific address and mention that if they don't get back to me within a reasonable timeframe, I might have to look into my rights regarding a rent reduction (Mietminderung). Can you expand on it so it sounds more authoritative and legally sound?",
